### Expand the published SWS 2.0 complete tooth-status ValueSet
GET http://localhost:8080/ValueSet/sws2-zahnstatus-complete/$expand
Authorization: Basic basic:secret

### Validate a published SWS tooth-status code
GET http://localhost:8080/ValueSet/$validate-code?url=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/ValueSet/sws2-zahnstatus-complete&system=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/CodeSystem/sws2-zahnstatus&code=c
Authorization: Basic basic:secret
# Expected: result=true

### Reject an unknown code in the published SWS namespace
GET http://localhost:8080/ValueSet/$validate-code?url=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/ValueSet/sws2-zahnstatus-complete&system=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/CodeSystem/sws2-zahnstatus&code=INVALID_CODE_XYZ
Authorization: Basic basic:secret
# Expected: result=false

### Reject a code from the retired local namespace
GET http://localhost:8080/ValueSet/$validate-code?url=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/ValueSet/sws2-zahnstatus-complete&system=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/CodeSystem/dental-befund-status&code=c
Authorization: Basic basic:secret
# Expected: retired system is rejected as unknown and cannot yield result=true
